\chi$ convergence sequences at additional times, pointwise comparisons, diagonal cuts, FVM self-convergence results, and field-difference maps are collected in the Supplementary Material. These verification results provide the numerical basis for the parametric study of Section 5 and the high-resolution analysis of Section 6.
